title: Fake CAPTCHA with paste-into-Run steps
severity: high
score: 55
tags: clickfix
attack: T1204.004, T1059.001
description: A fake verification page tells the visitor to open Run or a terminal (Win+R,
  Win+X) and paste. Kits write the command only after the checkbox click, so an automated
  run sees the steps but no clipboard write. Hidden steps count. A real challenge page never
  asks for either.
---
// A fake CAPTCHA with paste-into-Run steps.
fake_captcha_texts
| where exists(run_dialog_pages)
| distinct url
